  "difficulty": "hit",
  "question": "已知 $f(0) = 0$ ， $f'(0) = 1$ ，求 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\left[f\\left(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\right) + f\\left(\\frac{2}{n^2}\\right) + \\dots +f\\left(\\frac{n}{n^2}\\right)\\right]$ .",
  "answer": "$f(x) = f(0) + f'(0)x + o(x)$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 可利用 $f'(0)$ 的定义得到 $f(x)$ 在 x=0 附近的局部表达式，再代入所求极限式做计算."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "由于 $f'(0) = \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x) - f(0)}{x}$ ，则 $f(x) = f(0) + f'(0)x + o(x)$ ，从而"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l}f \\left(\\frac {1}{n ^ {2}}\\right) + f \\left(\\frac {2}{n ^ {2}}\\right) + \\dots + f \\left(\\frac {n}{n ^ {2}}\\right)&= \\frac {1}{n ^ {2}} + \\frac {2}{n ^ {2}} + \\dots + \\frac {n}{n ^ {2}} + n \\cdot o \\left(\\frac {1}{n}\\right)\\\\&= \\frac {n (n + 1)}{2 n ^ {2}} + o (1) \\rightarrow \\frac {1}{2}\\end{array}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "即"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left[ f \\left(\\frac {1}{n ^ {2}}\\right) + f \\left(\\frac {2}{n ^ {2}}\\right) + \\dots + f \\left(\\frac {n}{n ^ {2}}\\right)\\right] = \\frac {1}{2}."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$f(x) = f(0) + f'(0)x + o(x)$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "极限计算"
    ]
  },
